{"id":13,"titleZh":"亚伦·科普兰生日派对","titleEn":"Aaron Copland Birthday Party","date":"1961-02-12","dateZh":"1961 年 2 月 12 日","concepts":"不协和和弦、大跨度音程跳跃、奇拍改写","thesis":"1900 年出生的科普兰并不靠标新立异吓唬观众，而是用刺耳和弦和大跨度跳跃写出硬朗现代的美国声音。","plain":"为庆祝科普兰 60 岁生日，伯恩斯坦展示他温柔开朗之外更硬派的一面：初听刺耳的不协和和弦多听几次就会顺耳，把音域突然拉高拉低、把规整三拍改成五拍，就能让平淡旋律长出强烈的 20 世纪棱角。","scenes":["在钢琴上拆解科普兰《声明》：先按原音高但拉平跨度弹（怒气立刻减半），再换成 19 世纪传统和弦，结果当场退化成百年前的浪漫派老调，随后弹回原版对照。","先用传统三拍子弹《East Side, West Side》，再改成科普兰《剧院音乐》里的五拍（5/8）加高音怪音对比；压轴由亚伦·科普兰亲自登台执棒《墨西哥沙龙》。"],"category":"大师与杰作","bilibili":{"bvid":"BV1uU4y187Ds","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uU4y187Ds","title":"掘火中译：伯恩斯坦《年轻人的音乐会》| 艾伦·科普兰生日派对","duration":"53:23","uploader":"掘火档案（掘火中译）"},"scriptUrl":"https://leonardbernstein.com/lectures/television-scripts/young-peoples-concerts/aaron-copland-birthday-party","repertoire":[{"composer":"Copland","piece":"An Outdoor Overture","titleZh":"户外序曲","previewUrl":"https://audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com/itunes-assets/AudioPreview125/v4/7c/62/59/7c62594e-5258-a3d1-e0f3-6190afd6437c/mzaf_16315389469809528122.plus.aac.p.m4a","appleMusicUrl":"https://music.apple.com/us/album/an-outdoor-overture/1503542935?i=1503542939&uo=4","recordingArtist":"National Orchestral Institute Philharmonic & James Judd","recordingTrack":"An Outdoor Overture","youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Copland%20An%20Outdoor%20Overture+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Copland%20An%20Outdoor%20Overture"},{"composer":"Copland","piece":"Statements for Orchestra (Dogmatic)","titleZh":"声明：教条","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist":null,"recordingTrack":null,"youtubeSearchUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Copland%20Statements%20for%20Orchestra+Bernstein","biliSearchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=Copland%20Statements%20for%20Orchestra"},{"composer":"Copland","piece":"Dance from Music for the Theatre","titleZh":"剧院音乐：舞曲","previewUrl":null,"appleMusicUrl":null,"recordingArtist"